%% A Git-driven change — GitOps Fundamentals, lab exercise 4 ("You'll end with").
%% The attendee edits overlays/stage (count 2 to 3) and commits to main; Refresh makes Argo CD read
%% the new commit and report OutOfSync (Git 3, live 2); Sync moves the stage namespace forward to
%% 3 replicas. Nobody runs oc scale.
%% Shape (diagram-size-guard): LR, chain of 4, labels at most 2 lines.
flowchart LR
  EDIT(["edit overlays/stage<br/>count: 3"]) -->|"commit"| GIT[("main<br/>new commit")]
  GIT -->|"Refresh"| OOS["OutOfSync<br/>Git 3, live 2"]
  OOS -->|"Sync"| STAGE["stage namespace<br/>3 replicas"]
  classDef hi fill:#e00,stroke:#900,color:#fff;
  classDef done fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0d652d;
  class EDIT hi;
  class STAGE done;
